// # Unified Physically Based Rendering & 3D Raytracing Facade
//
// Logline: Master facade re-exporting all 49 BVH acceleration, ray intersection, microfacet BRDF/BSDF, volumetric scattering, and path tracing submodules.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim and unified API importing all companion submodules in pbr_raytracing.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular geometric primitives, acceleration structures, PBR materials, Monte Carlo samplers, and integrators.
//   2. Re-export public rendering pipelines, camera configurations, and BSDF evaluators.
//   3. Maintain full backwards compatibility and uniform type access for openOODA graphics applications.

